at:CN6a  a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria: Processing and keeping evidence of personal data for payroll, payroll and compliance with recording, information and reporting obligations, insofar as this is necessary on the basis of laws or norms of collective legal design or employment contract obligations."@en ;
