at:CN9a  a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria: Processing of special categories of personal data within the meaning of Art. 9 and a processing of personal data on criminal convictions and criminal offences within the meaning of Art. 10 GDPR within the framework of this exception are only permitted on the basis of a statutory authorization or on the basis of legal obligations."@en ;
    dpv:hasPersonalData dpv:SpecialCategoryPersonalData ;
