at:CN18  a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Image and acoustic processing, which are necessary for the preventive protection of persons or things in generally accessible places that are subject to the house law of the person responsible, due to violations of law that have already occurred or a special potential hazard in the nature of the place and no suitable means is available. In cases where employee representatives have to be formed, the existence of a valid works agreement or a valid consent of the personnel representation, which regulates the implementation of video surveillance, is a prerequisite. This exception does not apply to places that may be entered due to an existing contract obligation or due to the public interest of anyone."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-PreventativeProtection ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-ProtectionOfPersons ;
