    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of the Czech Republic and which involves: Processing (processing operations) carried out by individual lawyers and notaries (lawyers and notaries who are not in an employment relationship), using the necessary personal data only to provide legal services to the data subject (see recital 91 of the Regulation), and not systematically transferring them to third countries, for some of the processing operations on personal data of clients, a processor is not used, or there is no sharing/linking of personal data of clients of two or more individual lawyers."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-LinkingPersonalData ;
