lv:CN53 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Latvia and which involves: Data processing by lawyers, notaries, sworn bailiffs working individually and engaged in their professional activities related to the obligation of professional secrecy, provided that the processing operations do not involve systematic transmission to third countries."@en ;
    dpv:hasEntity impacto:dpv-SwornBailiffs ;
    dpv:hasLegalBasis impacto:dpv-ProfessionalSecrecyObligation ;
    dct:source lv:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN53" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:LV .

lv:CN54 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Latvia and which involves: Data processing carried out by an association, foundation, for the management of its members and donors in the framework of its regular activities, except processing of personal data of a sensitive nature;"@en ;
    dct:source lv:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN54" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:LV .

lv:CN55 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Latvia and which involves: Data processing by the association of apartment owners, the co-operative society of apartments or the community of apartment owners, in relation to the management of multi-apartment residential buildings and related buildings, and land, except processing on a large scale."@en ;
    dpv:hasEntity impacto:dpv-ApartmentOwner ;
    dpv:hasLocation impacto:loc-CooperativeSocietyOfApartments ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-LandManagement ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-ResidentialBuildingManagement ;
    dct:source lv:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN55" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:LV .

lv:CN56 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Latvia and which involves: Processing of data for the management of physical access controls and schedules for the calculation of working time, excluding special categories of personal data and/or other personal data of highly sensitive nature."@en ;
    dct:source lv:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN56" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:LV .

lv:CN57 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Latvia and which involves: Processing of data in connection with checks of alcohol or narcotic substances within the framework of transport activities arising from legal requirements in the law in order to verify that the driver is not under the influence of alcohol or narcotics."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:sector-law-RoadVehicleDriverAlcoholLevelVerification ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:sector-law-RoadVehicleDriverDrugInfluenceVerification ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:sector-law-RoadVehicleDriverSobrietyVerification ;
    dct:source lv:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN57" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:LV .

lv:CN58 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Latvia and which involves: Processing of data in relation to collective submissions laid down in the Local Government Law."@en ;
    dpv:hasDataSubject impacto:dpv-Refugee ;
    dpv:hasDataSubject impacto:dpv-Resident ;
    dpv:hasLegalBasis impacto:dpv-LocalGovernmentLaw ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-CollectiveSubmissionsManagement ;
    dct:source lv:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN58" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:LV .

es:CN59 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Spain and which involves: Processing carried out strictly under the guidelines established or authorized previously, by way of circulars or decisions issued by supervisory bodies, whenever the processing has not changed since it was authorized."@en ;
    impacto:hasExemptionBasis impacto:dpv-AuthorisedProcessing ;
    dct:source es:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN59" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:ES .

es:CN60 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Spain and which involves: Processing carried out strictly under the guidelines of codes of conduct approved by the Commission or by supervisory bodies, whenever a full DPIA has already been carried out within a context of a validated code of conduct, and is implemented with the measures and safeguards defined in the DPIA."@en ;
    dpv:hasEntity impacto:dpv-EuropeanCommission ;
    dpv:hasOrganisationalMeasure impacto:dpv-DPIAMeasures ;
    dpv:hasOrganisationalMeasure impacto:dpv-DPIASafeguards ;
    dct:source es:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN60" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:ES .

es:CN61 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Spain and which involves: Processing that is necessary in order to comply with a legal requirement or to complete a mission being carried out in the public interest or in the exercise of official authority vested in the controller, provided that there is no duty to carry out a DPIA within the legal mandate itself, whenever a full DPIA has already been performed."@en ;
    dct:source es:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN61" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:ES .

es:CN62 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Spain and which involves: Processing carried out by self-employed personnel who work on an individual basis in the exercise of their professional duties, especially physicians, healthcare professionals, or lawyers, unless two or more criteria established in the list of types of data processing that require impact assessment are met."@en ;
    dct:source es:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN62" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:ES .

es:CN63 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Spain and which involves: Processing carried out in relation to the internal administration of personnel working at SMEs, in order to face processing operations mandatory by law for the purposes of accounting, human resources management, payroll management, social security, and safety in the workplace, but never in relation to customer data."@en ;
    dct:source es:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN63" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:ES .

es:CN64a a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Spain and which involves: Processing carried out by owners’ associations and sub-associations in multi- occupancy properties, according as these are defined at article 2 (a, b, and d) of Law 49/1960 on Horizontal Property."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-ResidentialBuildingManagement ;
    dpv:hasDataSubject impacto:dpv-ApartmentOwner ;
    dpv:hasLocation impacto:dpv-MultiOccupancyProperty ;
    dpv:hasApplicableLaw impacto:legal-HorizontalPropertyLaw ;
    dpv:hasResponsibleEntity impacto:dpv-OwnersAssociation ;
    dct:identifier "CN64" ;
    dct:source es:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:ES .

es:CN64b a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Spain and which involves: Processing carried out by owners’ associations and sub-associations in multi- occupancy properties, according as these are defined at article 2 (a, b, and d) of Law 49/1960 on Horizontal Property."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose impacto:dpv-ResidentialBuildingManagement ;
    dpv:hasDataSubject impacto:dpv-ApartmentOwner ;
    dpv:hasLocation impacto:dpv-MultiOccupancyProperty ;
    dpv:hasApplicableLaw impacto:legal-HorizontalPropertyLaw ;
    dpv:hasResponsibleEntity impacto:dpv-OwnersSubAssociation ;
    dct:identifier "CN64" ;
